{"parse": {"title": "LAFP-06", "pageid": 136116, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-05\" title=\"LAFP-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LAFP-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-07\" title=\"LAFP-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LAFP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.87.E7.89.A9.E5.A6.82.E8.B0.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"万物如谜\">万物如谜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 万物如谜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">All Is but a Riddle</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>旧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>光<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>薄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>荷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>味<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3610106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_17.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_17\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_17\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_6_bg_17.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_6_bg_17.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_6_bg_17.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我准备出门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>午饭自己热一下冰箱里的菜，你听到了吧，阿德勒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>登山俱乐部究竟有什么魔力？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>连邻居聊天的时候都会说：“你找格蕾塔？应该是爬山去了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>也可能在划艇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门口的年轻人已经系好了鞋带，在垫子上跺了跺脚。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她背起登山包，转头看了一眼站起身的弟弟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>你要一起？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>上回你爬完卡尔文德尔山，还没到家就说再也不会参加任何周末体育活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>下棋，游泳，或者做些你喜欢的数学题，都是很好的消遣。也不用非要和我一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>我只是起来倒杯水！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>哈哈，好——对了，帮我个忙。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/35/Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1220\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格蕾塔丢来一把钥匙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少年头也没抬，将半空中的钥匙捞进手心。他的视线停留在报纸的填字游戏格上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>又在研究什么呢？打算像上次那样把老爸藏烟的柜子用密码锁上？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>那不过是个维吉尼亚密码。入门级别的谜题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>嗯，你如果有空，可以把后院的草坪修剪一下，老爸老妈都会很高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>而且我还没问过你呢，“拉普拉斯”又究竟有什么魔力？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>优秀的科研机构可不少，你怎么对那座大厦这么上心？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>因为我觉得那群人的理念和我一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/Cg-3_6_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她发现弟弟的语气认真起来。于是暂缓了开门的动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>一定有一种能够描述世间万物的统一的理论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>因为任何谜题都有其解答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>因为世界是一个填字游戏。只要沿着线索推演，一定能得到唯一的答案，既定的原理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>简单明了，清晰，理性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>密码不过是按照特定规律重新编排的符号，找到规律就能解明。如果还没有答案，那不是因为它从不存在，而是因为尚未被发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>我听过科算中心的讲座。那些研究员都坚信自己能发现真理。这简直太自负了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>——但就应该如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格蕾塔点了点头，笑着打开房门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_05\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_6_at_05.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_6_at_05.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_6_at_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>知道了。不用太紧张，你肯定能顺利收到拉普拉斯的邀请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我也帮你打听过，他们都说年纪不重要，是不是神秘学家也不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>只有天才才能敲开拉普拉斯的大门。这是唯一条件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>所以你肯定没问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他弯下腰，把带来的花放在墓碑前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那里已经有新鲜的花朵了。白菊花漫出了石板边沿，流淌到草坪上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_06\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_at_06.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_at_06.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_at_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>记得你的人很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>就连缪斯三世带来的“玩具箱”里，都有一段数据兢兢业业地模拟着你的固执。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>还是换个话题吧，我相信你也不愿听我在这里冗长地怀念过去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是说服自己，又或许是抗拒，密码学家从繁杂的思绪里重新择选了合适的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>箱子里那座高塔，那座用以解决“语言异化症”的巴别塔，并非最后的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——没错，人们得以再次用言语交流，前所未有地理解彼此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但代价是，所有人的认知都被统一的模型塑造。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>所有人齐声赞成，所有人齐声反对——这样的交流，又怎么可能是交流？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他凝视了墓碑上雕刻的字母太久，它们开始变得陌生。一切都如此失真，像是不切实际的梦境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……我和乌尔里希，各自出发，最终却都选择了炸毁这座高塔，拿到了塔里的核心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>于是，现在我们有了新的亟待解决的问题——核心上有一道密码锁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>而我对这道密码锁毫无头绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墓碑沉默地应对，但并不妨碍密码学家从记忆中解出格蕾塔可能会有的反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>呵，我知道，你一定会不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这本该是我的专长，毕竟找到线索，解开密码，需要的只是时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但这不是现在这颗锈钝的脑子，还能自信依赖的想法了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我已经很久没有做过自己的研究项目了，噢，是的，那些只能浪费时间的会议，还有仿佛在无限生成的批复文件——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我的时间已经被这些琐碎的事情填满了。我能听到大脑里老化的齿轮运转时，咯吱作响的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>也许……我已经失去了我曾经拥有的天赋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他苦笑着点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哈，也许有朝一日我会用上X那些发明的。这些事就算交给一个最愚钝的机器人，也不会办得比现在更糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白菊花窸窸窣窣地在流动的风中低语。万物的响动包围了一个沉默的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>噢！哑谜先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-306513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>您……也在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>循声望去，格蕾塔的学生抱着一打文件和一束花站在他身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……一会儿要到基金会开会，顺路看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你来看她了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>是的，我给老师带了一些新文章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这些文章……我还没有寄往《白日梦邮报》，也并不清楚这次是否会被拒收。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>只是，这次我采取了另外一种记录手法，在霍夫曼女士曾经的改良意见上的再次修订——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>所以我想在得到报社答复前，先带给霍夫曼女士看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我希望她看到，我终于学会了在无尽的“阅读”中做出那个最好的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>在“阅读”了那么多故事之后，以我的眼睛目睹的有限真相……是关于“暴雨”的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜稍稍让开，马库斯将怀里的花压在文章上，一道放在了墓碑前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>既不违背自己的心意，也不违背霍夫曼女士的指导。我找到了实现理想的记录手法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>当然……这肯定还有很多不足……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在一种尴尬的羞赧中马库斯表达清楚了自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她与寡言的密码学家并不算熟悉，格蕾塔是二者之间罕见的交集。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>哑谜先生，我以为您不会来到这里了……这不是指责的意思！我明白您当时的心境……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>但既然您来了，关于那个问题，您已经得到了答案吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员小心地询问着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>现在还没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但维持现状，也似乎对思考没有任何帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>嗯……“阅读”需要时间，求证也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>也许吧。你应该还有不少话想要和她说，那我便不打扰了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜伸手在口袋里摸了摸，金属罐在手心里散发着沉甸甸的冰凉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他换了只手，伸进另外的口袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>怎么了，哑谜先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>没什么。拿好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯摊开手，哑谜抓着一把东西放进她的手心，接着转身离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低下头。这些糖果她倒很熟悉，导师的口袋里也曾散落有这样的小东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰冷的、刺激性的气味令她眨了眨眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>噢，是……薄荷糖。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场剑拔弩张却毫无进展的会议终于结束。密码学家站在人来人往的大厅，有些恍惚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>匆忙的工作人员并未留意这位密码学家，他们脚步不停，手中的文件一摞比一摞厚重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……哈，以最大的投入功率来推动一颗最小的螺丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>毫无意义的资源浪费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嘀嘀——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯器适时响起，阻拦了他对于半小时前那场会议的厌弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>阿德勒研究员。如果手上没有紧急事务，请迅速返回科算中心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>关于高塔里的核心，我们有了新的发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>这枚核心会随着被观测而变化。我们得想一个新计划。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LAFP-06"}}